# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

tmp/

# Scratch from the tools in tools/*.mjs — a headless Chrome profile and the
# host pages they drive. Untracked, and oxlint should not read them either:
# a browser extension's bundled JS is not our code.
tools/.chrome*/
tools/.screens.html
tools/.edu.html

# Video masters. Image masters are committed — they are a megabyte or two and
# they are the source of truth for the WebPs beside them. A video master is
# 25 MB, which is larger than this entire repository's history, and git keeps
# it forever whether or not it is ever needed again. The encoded file that the
# page actually loads IS committed; keep the master wherever the renders live.
src/assets/**/*.vid.mp4
